ge/upload/t_thumb/sc134pv.jpg"}, {"id": 1825700, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc134pw.jpg"}, {"id": 1825701, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc134px.jpg"}, {"id": 1825702, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc134py.jpg"}, {"id": 1825703, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc134pz.jpg"}, {"id": 1825704, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc134q0.jpg"}], "slug": "open-for-business", "storyline": "It\u2019s a place where memories, nostalgia, and entertainment culture come together, inspired by different eras of video games and cinema \u2014 from cartridges and VHS tapes to modern consoles and collectible figures.\n\nMany products will remind players of the most iconic games, movies, and characters, evoking familiar emotions and memories.\n\nEverything takes place in an alternative universe filled with its own games, movies, characters, and franchises. Every product is part of a larger world that gradually unfolds as your store grows.", "summary": "Open For Business is a shop management simulator, but not a typical one. This isn\u2019t about selling water, food, or random everyday items. It\u2019s about nostalgia \u2014 that feeling you get when you pick up a game, a movie, a cartridge, or a VHS, and it actually means something. In this game, you build your own store and sell games, movies and animated films, consoles, collectible figures, and more \u2014 from retro VHS tapes and cartridges to modern entertainment.", "themes": [{"id": 28, "name": "Business"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/open-for-business", "videos": [{"id": 182484, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "E6ysV75XZuw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=E6ysV75XZuw", "title": "Open For Business - Video and Game Store Simulator", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/E6ysV75XZuw/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}